### `Coroutine timeout inside single-thread native dispatcher`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `withTimeoutOrNull` around a loop that calls blocking native delay/sleep on the same dispatcher never fires; JNI callbacks on that dispatcher starve | The dispatcher thread is blocked in native code; coroutine timeout and other jobs cannot run | Keep native calls in `withNode` short. Poll predicates via `withNode { … }` but sleep with `delay` on the coroutine scope **outside** `withNode`. Inject abort via `shouldAbort` checked each iteration |

